## 3. The language, by manifest and surface

What the core contract admits, what this profile implements, and what a composition provides, kept
apart: the contract treats every manifest as an opaque identifier, so **it admits all of them and
implements none**.

| Manifest or surface | This profile implements | What a composition provides | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|
| `broiler.javascript.wide` | **Implemented, partly**: the pinned edition's language and library. Over the whole pinned suite, with every surface below admitted, 100,368 of 101,723 variants pass, 158 fail, 44 exhaust a budget and 1,153 are skipped; **no percentage is published** | Every JavaScript composition root admits it; none is advertised | [`test262-wide.floor`](../../tests/conformance/floors/test262-wide.floor); [`roadmap.corrections.md`](roadmap.corrections.md), JSC-284 |
| `broiler.javascript.slice` | **Implemented**: the first manifest's subset, read by the same verifier | Every root | Rules N11 and N16; [`evidence/js-1/README.md`](evidence/js-1/README.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.numeric` | **Implemented**: a narrowing of the wide manifest, for the native form | Every root | Rule N16 |
| `broiler.javascript.binary` | **Implemented**: `ArrayBuffer`, the typed arrays and `DataView` | Roots that admit it | [`JsSurfaces.cs`](../../Broiler.VM.Profile.JavaScript.Format/JsSurfaces.cs); rule N16 |
| `broiler.javascript.dynamic` | **Implemented**: `eval` and the `Function` constructor, through the guest-load mediator and nowhere else | Roots that register a provider; a root that registers none refuses every load deterministically | Rule N13; [`roadmap.md`](roadmap.md) section 11 |
| `broiler.javascript.modules` | **Implemented**: the module goal, dynamic `import()` and JSON modules | Roots that register the resolve capability | [`roadmap.md`](roadmap.md) section 11 |
| `broiler.javascript.native` | **Implemented, partly**: the baseline native form on `x86-64`; `arm64` is **emitting-only** and runs nowhere | Roots whose native-execution cell reads `x86-64` | Rules X1 to X4 and K5; [`../../../docs/compositions.md`](../../../docs/compositions.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.bigint` | **Implemented** | Roots that admit it | [`decisions/0033-the-internal-bigint-value-and-the-gated-literal.md`](decisions/0033-the-internal-bigint-value-and-the-gated-literal.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.shadowrealm` | **Implemented** | Roots that admit it with `broiler.javascript.dynamic` | [`decisions/0040-admitting-shadowrealm.md`](decisions/0040-admitting-shadowrealm.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.shared` | **Implemented**: `SharedArrayBuffer` and `Atomics`, and agents a host starts | Roots that admit it with `broiler.javascript.binary` | [`decisions/0041-shared-memory-in-one-agent.md`](decisions/0041-shared-memory-in-one-agent.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.intl` | **Implemented, partly**: ECMA-402 in `de` and `en`; any other locale resolves to one of them | Roots that link the Intl data assembly | Rules N27 and N28; [`decisions/0027-intl-scope-and-data-strategy.md`](decisions/0027-intl-scope-and-data-strategy.md) |
| `broiler.javascript.temporal` | **Implemented**: every calendar of the Intl era and month code proposal, and zone names | Roots that admit it with `broiler.javascript.intl` and `broiler.javascript.bigint` | Rules N29 to N32; [`decisions/0058-time-zone-names.md`](decisions/0058-time-zone-names.md) |

